OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,4,Apolice, airports and hospitals in the
OL,5,Anorth-west of England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA global Microsoft outage is disrupting
OL,8,Fmost workplaces and services across the
OL,9,Fnorth-west of England.
OL,11,FNHS and police services, along with
OL,12,Fairports and schools, are warning
OL,13,Fpeople about emails being down and
OL,14,Ffinding work-around ways to help keep
OL,15,Fcontact.
