OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,4,Apolice, airports and hospitals in the
OL,5,Anorth-west of England
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreater Manchester, Lancashire,
OL,8,FCheshire and Merseyside Police forces
OL,9,Fhave posted on their websites, saying
OL,10,Fthere were issues with online forms and
OL,11,Fits live chat service, advising people
OL,12,Fto call 101 for time-critical
OL,13,Fnon-emergency reports.
OL,15,FA spokesman for Manchester Airport said
OL,16,Fthe outage had not affected any
OL,17,Foperational systems, and everything was
OL,18,Frunning as normal but its corporate
OL,19,Fset-up and "minor technical processes"
OL,20,Fwere affected.
